eaches. So you get a big helping of fruit and juices. Yum. This location was super busy on a weekday at lunch time. But the staff was hustling. There is parking in the back but it's tight. And don't you dare park there if you're not in the Smoothie King."},{"business_id":"kxgZLWWQNrM1JYuyo_XTlw","review_id":"4WvebvH_V3NoCqgutI2p4Q","date":"2016-03-17T14:36:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9091660976409912,"text_excerpt":"I have been really impressed lately by the employees at this particular Smoothie King. They are always polite and efficient. And even with a line out the door they always crank out product even faster than other locations with no line. Which is why I pass other Smoothie KIngs to go to this one. The crazy prices are not their fault which is why I go on Mondays."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
